[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_qmaql")
ID = "basic_combat"
title = "Combat"
text = "Each enemy has its own moveset like a set of card. One of those cards is choosen randomly each turn and disposed. At the same time you have to select a move for you to play. If you guessed right your move blocks the enemys.
The fight is lost for whoever hits the pain threshold first.
[b]Attack[/b] Try to deal some pain to the enemy. The attacks chance to hit increases with your built up advantage.
[B]Block[/B] Block an ATTACK to minimze increase of pain.
[B][/B]

Advantage is created when you deal a move and is doubled when you counter the enemys move.

If you run out of poise, the enemy will grapple you."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dlwkvnowhdyt3"
